ed_by_termin…_202607101941.mp4","in":5.04,"text":"They believed that they could capture the entire world in lines of code.","kw":["believed","could","capture","entire","world","lines","code"],"ch":11},{"t":32.4,"dur":6,"clip":"10_vr-winter/VR_demo_tape_degrading_202607101941.mp4","file":"assets/10_vr-winter/VR_demo_tape_degrading_202607101941.mp4","in":0,"text":"It was a promise of a new world, where we could escape the limits.","kw":["promise","world","where","could","escape","limits"],"ch":10},{"t":40.03,"dur":4,"clip":"09_arcade-era/Teenager's_face_emerging_VR_headset_202607101939.mp4","file":"assets/09_arcade-era/Teenager's_face_emerging_VR_headset_202607101939.mp4","in":4.88,"text":"A world where we could escape the confines of our own bodies.","kw":["world","where","could","escape","confines","bodies"],"ch":9},{"t":47.22,"dur":6,"clip":"08_vpl/Programmers_working_at_workstations_202607101938.mp4","file":"assets/08_vpl/Programmers_working_at_workstations_202607101938.mp4","in":0,"text":"In 1987, a small group of programmers thought they could escape the confines of reality.","kw":["small","group","programmers","thought","could","escape","confines","reality"],"ch":8},{"t":54.64,"dur":6,"clip":"07_nasa-view/Researcher_wearing_head-mounted_…_202607101936.mp4","file":"assets/07_nasa-view/Researcher_wearing_head-mounted_…_202607101936.mp4","in":0,"text":"In 1985, we believed we could escape into the machine.","kw":["believed","could","escape","machine"],"ch":7},{"t":62.05,"dur":5,"clip":"06_public-grid/Community_members_operate_video_…_202607101928.mp4","file":"assets/06_public-grid/Community_members_operate_video_…_202607101928.mp4","in":3.88,"text":"They believed they could use tape to create a new kind of society.","kw":["believed","could","tape","create","kind","society"],"ch":6},{"t":69.46,"dur":5.68,"clip":"05_damocles/Technicians_watching_subject_und…_202607101926.mp4","file":"assets/05_damocles/Technicians_watching_subject_und…_202607101926.mp4","in":0,"text